    "hcontent_file": "9178893357148448106",
    "preview_url": "https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/13984720066538470627/2365FA70617FE91F7ECE536B6E1DDE85EE8BA6A2/",
    "hcontent_preview": "13984720066538470627",
    "title": "招募候选刷新 | Recruitment Refresh",
    "description": "[h1]招募候选刷新 / Recruitment Refresh[/h1]\n[b]0.3.0 Alpha · 超凡帝国 · Windows x64 / WH3 9.0.5[/b]\n\n[b]必需物品：memreader Plus，请订阅并同时启用。此次单机实测依赖版本 0.15.2。[/b] 迁都为[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3830651933]独立 Mod[/url]，两者互不依赖。\n\n在普通领主/事务官招募页选择类别，点击底部“招募”右侧的刷新图标。免费，无额外回合冷却，单击直接刷新、不弹确认；选中的非空普通子类型不足 3 人时补足到 3 人，更多候选保持人数，不会持续累加。原版建筑、容量、费用和内容解锁条件保持。\n\n传奇、唯一、不朽、受伤、已招募及未知履历人物受到保护。商队、车队、冰雪宫廷训练、仪式及特殊来源不支持。空池不补员，旧档未知履历人物可能被保护，后续自然生成的普通候选才会获得可刷新履历。其他修改候选生成/招募池的 Mod 可能冲突，不宣称全种族或组合 Mod 兼容。\n\n[h2]实验性联机支持[/h2]\n[b]0.3.0 已加入多人同步，但未做联机实机验收，不保证无失步。[/b] 全部玩家须启用完全相同的本 Mod 包（包括语言）、memreader Plus 及其他 Mod/依赖版本。各端先关闭人物面板、比对版本/候选计划后执行，再核对结果。联机刷新会关闭所有端的人物面板，完成后需手动重开；单机仍自动返回招募页。\n\n混用版本、缺少 Mod、断线或成员变化可能拒绝或持续等待。原生调用单端失败不能自动回滚；结果不明或部分完成时停止操作，不自动重试。保留操作前独立存档，异常后读回该档，不手动清除锁。\n\n单机已在 9.0.5 基斯里夫通过牧首 5→5、波耶 1→3、保护人物保留、正常招募与原生控件避让。此次同时修复事件字符串截断造成的快照失效误判；候选保护和生成参数完整校验，补员性别模板按稳定人物 ID 选择。空间不足时隐藏图标。缺少依赖或引擎构建/原生结构未通过验证时停止刷新。禁用 Mod 不会撤销已保存的刷新和招募。\n\n[h2]English[/h2]\nRequires memreader Plus enabled alongside this Mod (SP tested with 0.15.2). Free one-click ordinary lord/hero candidate refresh in Immortal Empires, using the small icon beside Recruit. A selected nonempty ordinary subtype fills to at least 3; larger pools retain their size and repeated refreshes do not accumulate candidates. Normal buildings, capacity, gold and content requirements remain. Legendary, unique, immortal, wounded, recruited and unknown-history characters are protected. Empty pools, caravans/convoys, special training and ritual recruitment are excluded.\n\n[b]0.3.0 adds EXPERIMENTAL multiplayer synchronization; native multiplayer has NOT been tested. OOS-free operation is not guaranteed.[/b] All players need identical Mod packages (including language), memreader Plus and matching other Mods/dependencies. All peers close character panels, compare versions/candidate plans, execute and compare results. MP panels must be reopened manually afterward; SP still reopens automatically. Mixed versions, missing Mods, disconnects or membership changes may reject or stall operations. Native failure on one peer cannot be rolled back automatically. Keep a pre-operation save; restore it after uncertainty instead of retrying or clearing locks.\n\nSingle-player regression passed with Kislev on Windows x64 / game 9.0.5: Patriarch 5→5, Boyar 1→3, protected candidates, normal recruitment and native-control clearance. This update fixes event-string truncation and makes eligibility/gender planning deterministic. No universal faction or overhaul compatibility claim.\n\n[url=https://github.com/XenoAmess/total_war_warhammer_3_dev/tree/main/mods/recruitment_refresh]源码与验收记录 / Source and acceptance[/url]\n\n[h2]实机：领主招募页刷新图标，避让原生按钮 / Native lord recruitment icon[/h2]\n[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/total_war_warhammer_3_dev/main/mods/recruitment_refresh/workshop/screenshots/lord-refresh-icon.jpg[/img]\n\n[h2]实机：单击刷新后的领主候选 / Lord candidates after one-click refresh[/h2]\n[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/total_war_warhammer_3_dev/main/mods/recruitment_refresh/workshop/screenshots/lord-refreshed.jpg[/img]\n\n[h2]实机：牧首招募页刷新图标 / Native Patriarch recruitment icon[/h2]\n[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/total_war_warhammer_3_dev/main/mods/recruitment_refresh/workshop/screenshots/hero-final.jpg[/img]\n",
